  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: b10de7e3a4c14e1f8a9d5c2b6f7e8a01, type: 3}
  m_Name: Rocky Terrain
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  DisplayName: Rocky Terrain
  Description: 'The shattered high cold desert of the Pamir: black hornstone combs
    above broad flat pamirs, teresken and silver cushions on the gravel, lapis in
    the marble bands, and lamp-lit stone houses on the fan-heads where led channels
    water bearded red wheat. Not a tree in the east; in the sheltered valleys a line
    of crooked birch beside each stream. Travellers tell of a dragon in the still
    lake, a tower where caravans trade in silence, and a ruby mountain whose stones
    glow after sunset.'
