  - Field: Description
    Fingerprint: 'The shattered high cold desert of the Pamir: black hornstone combs
      above broad flat pamirs, teresken and silver cushions on the gravel, lapis
      in the marble bands, and lamp-lit stone houses on the fan-heads where led channels
      water bearded red wheat. Not a tree in the east; in the sheltered valleys a
      line of crooked birch beside each stream. Travellers tell of a dragon in the
      still lake, a tower where caravans trade in silence, and a ruby mountain whose
      stones glow after sunset.'
